{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The complete set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-values satisfying the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e7300c02497adc66e4d5809cfac9a54ada4a5dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-4}{x^2-1}&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"39\" /> is the set of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117915fd301007e4da37cdef923bd79b6ed048c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } x&gt;2 \\text{ or } x&lt;-2 \\text{ or} -1&lt;x&lt;1\\quad  \\text{(B) } x&gt;2 \\text{ or } x&lt;-2\\quad \\\\ \\text{(C) } x&gt;1 \\text{ or } x&lt;-2\\qquad\\qquad\\qquad\\quad \\text{(D) } x&gt;1 \\text{ or } x&lt;-1\\quad \\\\ \\text{(E) } x \\text{ is any real number except 1 or -1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"451\" height=\"57\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factor the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e54da0d47f940c02f6ccc1cf9f2ec6d8f5fc3e41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x+2)(x-2)}{(x+1)(x-1)}&gt;0\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" />\nNote that the graph intersects the x-axis at when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc1be1ffd4fbdeada68bb1b813b704f692b6571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e28aa3f41800e791e16ea90c0ed9b08ee13c6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so check the sign of the result to see if it is positive.  After testing, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07f0146def05358469b8fc546549d08c7984720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7520f1d4a703308c2b7c8a05e2a52b307d07ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820c190d962281aa2f9f8050cf0b21209c1a8653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em